Rips_WithdrawProtocolFee
├── when the caller has neither admin nor operator role
│   └── it should revert.
├── when there is no accrued fee for the currency
│   └── it should revert.
└── when there is accrued fee for the currency
    ├── it should reset the accrued fee to zero.
    ├── it should transfer the fee to the fee recipient.
    ├── it should emit a {ProtocolFeeWithdrawn} event.
    └── when the caller has operator role
        └── it should succeed.
